Package: 7zip-gui-cpp
Version: @VERSION@-@REV@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libqt6widgets6, p7zip-full, libxcb-cursor0
Recommends: qt6-gtk-platformtheme, nemo | nautilus | thunar | caja | dolphin
Suggests: python3-nautilus, python3-gi
Maintainer: 7zip-gui-cpp
Description: GNOME-friendly archive manager (Qt 6 + 7z)
 Native-style Linux GUI for p7zip: browse, create, extract and test
 archives (7z, zip, tar, rar, iso, and more).
 .
 Features:
  - Browse archives in a table view
  - Create archives with format, level and password options
  - Extract and test integrity
  - File manager context menus (Nemo, Nautilus, Thunar, Caja, Dolphin)
  - Uses system Qt 6 (GTK platform theme recommended)
